  "about": "Known answers for a person's key at a place, under both derivations in use today. Generated by scripts/gen-place-keys-kat.ts; canonical here, copied byte for byte by every other implementation. relationshipKey is BRC-42 to self under 'relationship-<first 16 hex of sha256(place)>:1:0' (src/bodies; a body's vouch names it). siteKey is BRC-42 to self under '2-admin plexus site-<origin> <version>' (src/places; the Plexus Auth approver signs in with it). For one web site they differ: which becomes the one place key is decision 11 of semantos-core docs/design/CLAIMS-AND-REQUIREMENTS.md. Roots are sha256('gip-v2-place-keys-kat/<label>') read as a scalar; bodies-kat-holder is the holder root of bodies_kat.json.",
